/Pg 106 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
2099 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 655 0 R
/T (The advantages of using PCA include reducing the dimensionality of the data, which simplifies analysis, reduces computational cost, and mitigates the risk of overfitting while retaining the essential patterns and relationships in the data. )
/E (The advantages of using PCA include reducing the dimensionality of the data, which simplifies analysis, reduces computational cost, and mitigates the risk of overfitting while retaining the essential patterns and relationships in the data. )
/Pg 106 0 R
/K [6]
>>
